      <item>
        <title>The Stowe Ranger</title>
        <description>Head Ranger Barry Smith tells us about the delights and challenges of managing Stowe Gardens.&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;https://www.nationaltrust.org.uk/visit/oxfordshire-buckinghamshire-berkshire/stowe-gardens&apos; target=&apos;blank&apos;&gt;Stowe Gardens website&lt;/a&gt;</description>
