      <item>
        <title>Political gardening</title>
        <description>Back in the 1700s Lord Cobham had strong views and ambitious plans which Barry helps us find out with a wander around the garden.&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;https://www.nationaltrust.org.uk/visit/oxfordshire-buckinghamshire-berkshire/stowe-gardens&apos; target=&apos;blank&apos;&gt;Stowe Gardens website&lt;/a&gt;</description>
