        <guid isPermaLink="true">https://greatouseways.info/assets/audio/stowe.mp3</guid>
      </item>
    
      <item>
        <title>Rinsing a river</title>
        <description>It&apos;s September in Buckingham which means it&apos;s time to get the river back in shape and Mayor Fran Davies tells us how they do it. &lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;https://www.buckingham-tc.gov.uk/town-council-services/events/&apos; target=&apos;_blank&apos;&gt;Buckingham Events&lt;/a&gt;</description>
