      <item>
        <title>Sunday swarm</title>
        <description>It&apos;s a nippy Sunday morning in Stony Straford which means it&apos;s time to join the local Bluetits swarm for a swim. &lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;https://www.facebook.com/groups/miltonkeynesbluetits/&apos; target=&apos;_blank&apos;&gt;Milton Keynes Bluetits&lt;/a&gt;</description>
