      </item>
    
      <item>
        <title>Bard of Stony</title>
        <description>Nova Carmen, Bard of Stony Stratford, shares some tips, and a poem, to help us get creative on the long walk to Kings Lynn. &lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;https://bardofstony.weebly.com/&apos; target=&apos;_blank&apos;&gt;Bard of Stony Stratford&lt;/a&gt;</description>
