      <item>
        <title>A place of pilgrimage</title>
        <description>The new city of Milton Keynes contains some ancient gems including St Mary&apos;s Chapel. Camille Poole shows us around.&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;https://www.mkcdc.org.uk/discover-bradwell-abbey&apos; target=&apos;_blank&apos;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;</description>
