        <guid isPermaLink="true">https://greatouseways.info/assets/audio/bradwell_abbey.mp3</guid>
      </item>
    
      <item>
        <title>Feeding from afar</title>
        <description>Richard Wilde from Milton Keynes museum tells us what an old windmill is doing in a new city and the clue is the canal-side setting... &lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&apos;https://miltonkeynesmuseum.org.uk/about-us/contact/bradwell-windmill/&apos; target=&apos;_blank&apos;&gt;Website&lt;/a&gt;</description>
